{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_17","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"command -v python3; command -v python3.14; command -v pytest; ls -d .venv*; cat tests/conftest.py; nl -ba adapters/passthrough_adapter.py | sed -n '155,280p'; nl -ba tests/test_passthrough_adapter.py | sed -n '1,65p'\"","aggregated_output":"/Users/aazhiry1/.local/bin/python3\n/Users/aazhiry1/.local/bin/python3.14\n.venv\ncat: tests/conftest.py: No such file or directory\n   155\t    return value if low <= value <= high else default\n   156\t\n   157\t\n   158\tdef _env_bool(environ: Mapping[str, str], name: str, default: bool) -> bool:\n   159\t    raw = str(environ.get(name, \"\")).strip().lower()\n   160\t    if raw in (\"1\", \"true\", \"yes\", \"on\"):\n   161\t        return True\n   162\t    if raw in (\"0\", \"false\", \"no\", \"off\"):\n   163\t        return False\n   164\t    return default\n   165\t\n   166\t\n   167\t@dataclass(frozen=True)\n   168\tclass PassthroughLimits:\n   169\t    \"\"\"Эффективные лимиты шва; ядру `max_parallel_*` передаются параметрами.\"\"\"\n   170\t\n   171\t    max_parallel_calls: int = DEFAULT_MAX_PARALLEL_CALLS\n   172\t    max_parallel_depth: int = DEFAULT_MAX_PARALLEL_DEPTH\n   173\t    max_body_bytes: int = DEFAULT_MAX_BODY_BYTES\n   174\t    accumulator_max_bytes: int = DEFAULT_ACC_MAX_BYTES\n   175\t    accumulator_max_keys: int = DEFAULT_ACC_MAX_KEYS\n   176\t    accumulator_max_process_bytes: int = DEFAULT_ACC_MAX_PROCESS_BYTES\n   177\t    connect_timeout_s: float = DEFAULT_CONNECT_TIMEOUT_S\n   178\t    read_timeout_s: float = DEFAULT_READ_TIMEOUT_S  # совместимость старого конструктора\n   179\t    idle_timeout_s: float = DEFAULT_IDLE_TIMEOUT_S\n   180\t    total_timeout_s: float = DEFAULT_TOTAL_TIMEOUT_S\n   181\t    safety_cap_s: float = DEFAULT_SAFETY_CAP_S\n   182\t    heartbeat_interval_s: float = 12.0\n   183\t    poll_interval_s: float = 0.1\n   184\t    reader_join_timeout_s: float = 0.2\n   185\t    read_queue_max_entries: int = 1\n   186\t    repetition_max_repeats: int = DEFAULT_MAX_REPETITION_REPEATS\n   187\t    repetition_max_token_len: int = DEFAULT_MAX_REPETITION_TOKEN_LEN\n   188\t    repetition_guard_enabled: bool = False\n   189\t    invoke_normalization_enabled: bool = False\n   190\t\n   191\t    @classmethod\n   192\t    def from_env(\n   193\t        cls, environ: Optional[Mapping[str, str]] = None\n   194\t    ) -> \"PassthroughLimits\":\n   195\t        \"\"\"Лимиты из окружения; нечисловое и неположительное значение -> default.\"\"\"\n   196\t        env = os.environ if environ is None else environ\n   197\t        return cls(\n   198\t            max_parallel_calls=_positive_int(\n   199\t                env, ENV_MAX_PARALLEL_CALLS, DEFAULT_MAX_PARALLEL_CALLS\n   200\t            ),\n   201\t            max_parallel_depth=_positive_int(\n   202\t                env, ENV_MAX_PARALLEL_DEPTH, DEFAULT_MAX_PARALLEL_DEPTH\n   203\t            ),\n   204\t            max_body_bytes=_positive_int(\n   205\t                env, ENV_MAX_BODY_BYTES, DEFAULT_MAX_BODY_BYTES\n   206\t            ),\n   207\t            accumulator_max_bytes=_positive_int(\n   208\t                env, ENV_ACC_MAX_BYTES, DEFAULT_ACC_MAX_BYTES\n   209\t            ),\n   210\t            accumulator_max_keys=_positive_int(\n   211\t                env, ENV_ACC_MAX_KEYS, DEFAULT_ACC_MAX_KEYS\n   212\t            ),\n   213\t            accumulator_max_process_bytes=_positive_int(\n   214\t                env, ENV_ACC_MAX_PROCESS_BYTES, DEFAULT_ACC_MAX_PROCESS_BYTES\n   215\t            ),\n   216\t            connect_timeout_s=_positive_float(\n   217\t                env,\n   218\t                \"BRIDGE_CONNECT_TIMEOUT_S\",\n   219\t                _positive_float(env, ENV_CONNECT_TIMEOUT_S, DEFAULT_CONNECT_TIMEOUT_S),\n   220\t            ),\n   221\t            read_timeout_s=_positive_float(\n   222\t                env, ENV_READ_TIMEOUT_S, DEFAULT_READ_TIMEOUT_S\n   223\t    